{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"一、七年，春王三月，叔姬歸于紀。滕侯卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"何以不名？微國也。微國則其稱侯何？不嫌也。春秋貴賤不嫌同號，美惡不嫌同辭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"二、夏，城中丘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"中丘者何？內之邑也。城中丘，何以書？以重書也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"三、齊侯使其弟年來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"其稱弟何？母弟稱弟，母兄稱兄。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"四、秋，公伐邾婁。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"五、冬，天王使凡伯來聘，戎伐凡伯于楚丘以歸。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_7_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_7","textTraditional":"凡伯者何？天子之大夫也。此聘也，其言伐之何？執之也。執之則其言伐之何？大之也。曷為大之？不與夷狄之執中國也。其地何？大之也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}